[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11042.87, "timestamp": "03:04:02", "text": "事情是有可能转变的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11047.03, "timestamp": "03:04:07", "text": "周围，​​如果我在那儿也没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11050.07, "timestamp": "03:04:10", "text": "嗯，你们管这种优质汽车叫什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11057.11, "timestamp": "03:04:17", "text": "不妨。很明显，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11059.11, "timestamp": "03:04:19", "text": "你非常像的那种人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11061.51, "timestamp": "03:04:21", "text": "感兴趣。你非常注重细节。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11063.83, "timestamp": "03:04:23", "text": "方向正确吗？所以就好像，好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11065.91, "timestamp": "03:04:25", "text": "是啊，还不如把额外的钱拿走呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11067.99, "timestamp": "03:04:27", "text": "确保一切看起来都像这样的步骤"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11071.349, "timestamp": "03:04:31", "text": "完美无瑕。是的，我就像一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11074.469, "timestamp": "03:04:34", "text": "完美主义者。我不知道为什么。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11076.79, "timestamp": "03:04:36", "text": "内容方面也是如此，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11079.269, "timestamp": "03:04:39", "text": "视频、照片等等。我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11081.83, "timestamp": "03:04:41", "text": "太挑剔了，不这么做不行，而且每个人都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11084.389, "timestamp": "03:04:44", "text": "我周围的人就像运动健将上传短裤一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11087.269, "timestamp": "03:04:47", "text": "它能提升你的频道等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11090.07, "timestamp": "03:04:50", "text": "通过Joathon，我好像能够获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11092.309, "timestamp": "03:04:52", "text": "摆脱那种完美主义，就像这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11095.75, "timestamp": "03:04:55", "text": "好吧，先别管它，然后就像，是的，我们都开始了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11098.71, "timestamp": "03:04:58", "text": "在某个可以上传的地方，我"}]